  "description": "Road feel first, extra watts second: the Teammachine 01 AMP ONE takes the instincts of a pure race bike and turns them up.\nAt the core is our uncompromising 01 Premium Carbon layup, tuned to deliver the highest stiffness while driving weight relentlessly down. The result is a sub-10kg e-road bike with 200 watts of smooth, natural assistance from the TQ-HPR40 motor system – territory no one else is playing in. Power-to-weight isn’t a claim here; it’s the entire point.\nHandling excels as road-first, with geometry, balance and feedback mirroring an analogue carbon race bike. Over broken surfaces and long hours, our Tuned Compliance Concept Race takes the edge off rough tarmac without dulling speed. A discreet top-tube display, full Shimano integration, and smartbox connectivity keep control seamless and intuitive.\nSpecced with Shimano Dura-Ace Di2, our ICS Carbon Evo one-piece cockpit, DT Swiss ARC 1100 38mm wheels, this race bike looks every bit the pro – and rides like it, too.",
